@startuml User_Photobooth_SSD

actor "User\n(Tourist/Guest)" as User
participant "UI: Photobooth" as UI
participant "Camera Service" as Camera
participant "Database" as DB

== Access Photobooth ==

User -> UI: Access photobooth feature
activate UI

UI -> Camera: Request camera permission
activate Camera
Camera --> User: Show camera permission dialog

alt Permission denied
    User -> Camera: Deny permission
    Camera --> UI: Permission denied
    UI --> User: Show error message
else Permission granted
    User -> Camera: Allow camera
    Camera --> UI: Camera access granted
    
    UI -> UI: Initialize face tracking
    
    UI -> DB: Fetch available filters
    activate DB
    DB --> UI: Return filters list\n(by category: general, head, eyes, frame, border)
    deactivate DB
    
    Camera -> UI: Stream camera feed
    
    UI --> User: Display camera view with filters
end

deactivate Camera
deactivate UI

== Select Filter ==

User -> UI: Browse and select filter
activate UI

UI -> UI: Load selected filter image

UI -> UI: Apply filter overlay on camera feed\n(position, scale, rotate based on face tracking)

UI --> User: Display live preview with filter
deactivate UI

== Capture Photo ==

User -> UI: Click "Capture" button
activate UI

UI -> UI: Render camera feed + filter overlay\non canvas

UI -> UI: Convert canvas to PNG image

UI --> User: Show photo preview
deactivate UI

== Review and Save Photo ==

User -> UI: Review captured photo
activate UI

alt User satisfied
    User -> UI: Click "Download" button
    
    UI -> UI: Trigger download\n(save to device)
    
    UI --> User: Photo downloaded
    
    UI --> User: Return to camera view
else User wants to retake
    User -> UI: Click "Retake" button
    
    UI --> User: Return to camera view
end

deactivate UI

== Change Filter ==

User -> UI: Select different filter
activate UI

UI -> UI: Load new filter image

UI -> UI: Update overlay on camera feed

UI --> User: Display with new filter
deactivate UI

== Exit Photobooth ==

User -> UI: Close photobooth
activate UI

UI -> Camera: Stop camera stream
activate Camera
Camera --> UI: Camera stopped
deactivate Camera

UI --> User: Return to previous page
deactivate UI

@enduml
